sdata> -- PE-7 code-review MAJOR-1: BREAK's debug sub-prompt (Inspect_PDV) shares the
sdata> -- same missing-echo defect as Run_REPL's top-level prompt, reachable under
sdata> -- piped/non-tty stdin exactly like Run_REPL's own case -- Interactive_Mode
sdata> -- is True for the whole REPL session regardless of tty status, so the debug
sdata> -- prompt loop runs and reads real commands (CONTINUE here) via the same
sdata> -- unechoed Get_Line pattern PE-7 fixes at the top level. Direct regression
sdata> -- guard, written to Standard_Error to match this prompt's own stream.
sdata> NEW
sdata> REPEAT 2
sdata> LET X = RECNO()
sdata> BREAK
sdata> RUN
[debug:record 1]> CONTINUE
[debug:record 2]> CONTINUE
RUN complete. 2 records and 1 variables processed.
sdata> QUIT
